:: Wraith Snatched Home Bailey
<<endevent>>
<<pass 10>><<effects>><<getTarget>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
<<set $baileyWraithPool to []>>
<<run $baileyWraithPool.push(
	"The hand that feeds. The hand that strikes. The same hand.",
	"Product. Commodity. Ward.",
	"It counts them at night. The children. The money. The doors.",
	"The serpent coils tighter when it sleeps."
)>>
<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 15>>
	<<run $baileyWraithPool.push(
		"The serpent holds on with its fangs now."
	)>>
<</if>>
<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom lt 30>>
	<<run $baileyWraithPool.push(
		"It holds on so tightly. It knows.",
		"You can feel it slipping. Can't you?",
		"Its grip loosens. The serpent pretends not to notice."
	)>>
<</if>>
<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
	<<run $baileyWraithPool.push(
		"The serpent counts the bars to its cage. It knows the number by heart.",
		"The serpent lies in wait. Hungry. Lonely."
	)>>
<</if>>
<<if $hcEndings and $hcEndings.length gte 1>>
	<<run $baileyWraithPool.push(
		"The gaoler locked <<nnpc_himself 'Bailey'>> in the cage.",
		"Prisoners and gaolers of one another."
	)>>
<</if>>
<<if $hcEndings and $hcEndings.includes("S")>>
	<<run $baileyWraithPool.push("The gaoler's chains were never for the prisoner.")>>
<</if>>
<<if $syndromeBailey>>
	<<run $baileyWraithPool.push(
		"<<pShe 'Ivory Wraith'>> <<pverb 'does not' 'do not' 'Ivory Wraith'>> want to leave.",
		"<<pShes 'Ivory Wraith'>> home.",
		"Two serpents in the same pit."
	)>>
<</if>>
<<if $syndromeBaileyBuild gte 1>>
	<<run $baileyWraithPool.push(
		"<<pShe 'Ivory Wraith'>> defended you.",
		"<<pShe 'Ivory Wraith'>> <<pverb 'understands' 'understand' 'Ivory Wraith'>> the cage."
	)>>
<</if>>
<<if $syndromeBaileyBuild gte 3>>
	<<run $baileyWraithPool.push(
		"The serpent doesn't know what to do with forgiveness."
	)>>
<</if>>
<<if $player.elkscarred>>
	<<run $baileyWraithPool.push(
		"The Elk sees you too, serpent.",
	)>>
<</if>>
<<if getBornChildren().length gte 1>>
	<<run $baileyWraithPool.push("Eggs in the serpent's nest.")>>
<</if>>
<<if $baileydefeated gte 5>>
	<<run $baileyWraithPool.push("<<pShes 'Ivory Wraith'>> stronger than you now.")>>
	<<if !$baileySeen.includes("wraithMock")>><<baileySeenAdd "wraithMock">><<npcincr Bailey dom -1>><<ldom "Bailey">><</if>>
<</if>>
<<if C.npc["Ivory Wraith"].lust gte 15>>
	<<run $baileyWraithPool.push(
		"I was here first, serpent."
	)>>
<</if>>
<<if $awareness gte 400>>
	<<run $baileyWraithPool.push("<<pShe 'Ivory Wraith'>> <<pverb 'has' 'have' 'Ivory Wraith'>> seen the holes. <<pShe 'Ivory Wraith'>> <<pverb 'knows' 'know' 'Ivory Wraith'>> what you are.")>>
<</if>>
<<if $baileyWraithSeen gte 2>>
	<<run $baileyWraithPool.push(
		"Again. Always again. The serpent never learns.",
		"It pretends not to see."
	)>>
<</if>>
<<if $rentTime lte 0>>
	<<run $baileyWraithPool.push("<<pShe 'Ivory Wraith'>> <<pverb 'owes' 'owe' 'Ivory Wraith'>>. <<pShe 'Ivory Wraith'>> always <<pverb 'owes' 'owe' 'Ivory Wraith'>>. The serpent makes sure of it.")>>
<</if>>
<<if $money gte 5000000>>
	<<run $baileyWraithPool.push("Richer than the serpent now. Does it know?")>>
<</if>>
<<if C.npc.Robin and C.npc.Robin.love gte 60>>
	<<run $baileyWraithPool.push("The little bird sings for it. The serpent will consume them both.")>>
<</if>>
<<if C.npc.Bailey.love gte 30>>
	<<run $baileyWraithPool.push("It loves the serpent. The serpent only knows how to devour.")>>
<</if>>
<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 90>>
	<<run $baileyWraithPool.push("Total. Absolute. The serpent owns even the air it breathes.")>>
<</if>>

<<if $baileyWraithSeen and $baileyWraithSeen gte 3>>
	Your door swings open. <span class="bailey-red">It's <<baileyTitleNarration>>.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<He>> doesn't speak. <<He>> crosses the room towards you unhurriedly.
	<br><br>
<<elseif $baileyWraithSeen and $baileyWraithSeen gte 1>>
	Your door swings open. <span class="bailey-red">It's <<baileyTitleNarration>>.</span>
	<br><br>

	"This again," <<he>> says. <<He>> enters your room. <<His>> jaw is set.
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	Your door swings open violently. <span class="bailey-red">It's <<baileyTitleNarration>>.</span>
	<br><br>

	"You're being noisy," <<he>> says. <<Hes>> holding an envelope in the hand that isn't on your doorknob. <<He>> looks at the one leg you hung outside your open window with a frown.
	<br><br>

	Your head tilts at an angle that makes your neck crack. <<He>> meets your eyes and <<his>> widen for just one moment before <<he>> steps forward.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<set _wraith to $baileyWraithPool.pluck()>>
Your mouth opens.
<br><br>

"<span class="wraith"><<print _wraith>></span>"
<br><br>

<<if $baileyWraithSeen and $baileyWraithSeen gte 1>>
	Bailey grabs your arm. <<He>> avoids looking you in the eye.
	<br><br>

	"Shut up," <<he>> says.
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
		Bailey's jaw tightens. <<He>> frowns at you for a long moment before grabbing your arm. Hard.
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		Bailey takes a half-step back. Then <<his>> hand closes around your wrist.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	"Shut up," <<he>> says.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<link [[Next|Wraith Snatched Home Bailey 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Wraith Snatched Home Bailey 2
<<pass 5>><<effects>><<getTarget>>
<<person1>>

<<He>> drags you down the hallway to <<his>> office. Your feet scrape against the floor. Your free hand claws at the doorframe. A translucent limb reaches from a window. Bailey kicks the door shut behind you.
<br><br>

<<He>> pulls you around <<his>> desk.
<br><br>

<<set $baileyWraithResisted to 0>>
<<set _wraith to $baileyWraithPool.length gt 0 ? $baileyWraithPool.pluck() : "...">>
"<span class="wraith"><<print _wraith>></span>"
<br><br>

<<if $baileyWraithSeen and $baileyWraithSeen gte 1>>
	Bailey ignores you. <<He>> shoves you onto your knees next to <<his>> desk chair, before sitting down. <<He>> picks up a pen, refusing to look at you.<<if $syndromeBaileyBuild gte 1>><<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">><</if>>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	<<He>> slaps you across the face.<<gpain>><<pain 4>><<gstress>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>

	Your head reels for a moment before it turns back towards <<him>>, slowly.
	<br><br>

	"<span class="wraith">That won't work, serpent. This one's mine tonight.</span>"
	<br><br>

	Bailey sneers before <<he>> catches <<himself>>. <<He>> shoves you onto your knees next to <<his>> desk chair and sits down. <<He>> picks up a pen and starts writing. <<He>> glares at you from the corner of <<his>> eyes.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

Something in you lurches. Your hands curl into fists against the carpet.
<br><br>

<<link [[Stand up.|Wraith Snatched Home Bailey Stand 1]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Stay still.|Wraith Snatched Home Bailey Still 1]]>><<set $baileyWraithResisted += 1>><<control `Math.floor(currentSkillValue('willpower') / 10)`>><</link>><<ggcontrol>>
<br>


:: Wraith Snatched Home Bailey Stand 1
<<pass 5>><<effects>><<getTarget>>
<<person1>>

Your body rises from the floor. Your legs carry you towards the door.
<br><br>

Bailey shoves you down by your shoulders, forcing you back onto your knees.<<gpain>><<pain 4>><<gstress>><<stress 6>>
<br><br>

"<span class="wraith">Persistent,</span>" your mouth says. "<span class="wraith">Like all vermin.</span>"
<br><br>

<<if $baileyWraithSeen and $baileyWraithSeen gte 1>>
	<<He>> doesn't respond.
<<else>>
	"Sit," <<he>> snarls.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Wraith Snatched Home Bailey 3]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Wraith Snatched Home Bailey Still 1
<<pass 5>><<effects>><<getTarget>>
<<person1>>

You fight it. A pressure behind your ribs, pushing outward. Your fingers dig into your palms until your knuckles go white.<<gstress>><<stress 6>><<gtrauma>><<trauma 6>>
<br><br>

You stay on your knees.
<br><br>

<<if $syndromeBaileyBuild gte 1>>
	Bailey is watching you over the top of <<his>> papers. <<He>> goes back to writing. <<if $syndromeBaileyBuild gte 1>><<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">><</if>>
<<else>>
	Bailey doesn't look up from <<his>> papers.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Wraith Snatched Home Bailey 3]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Wraith Snatched Home Bailey 3
<<pass 15>><<effects>><<getTarget>>
<<person1>>

Time passes. You don't know how much. The office clock ticks.
<br><br>

<<if $syndromeBaileyBuild gte 1>>
	Bailey rests a hand on the back of your neck. It's more gentle than you expect.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

Something lurches again. Stronger this time. Your legs tense.
<br><br>

<<willpowerdifficulty 200 800 true>>
<<if $willpowerSuccess>>
	<<link [[Stand up|Wraith Snatched Home Bailey Stand 2]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Stay still|Wraith Snatched Home Bailey Still 2]]>><<set $baileyWraithResisted += 1>><<control `Math.floor(currentSkillValue('willpower') / 10)`>><</link>><<ggcontrol>> | <span class="green">Willpower</span>
<<else>>
	<span class="wraith"><<link [[Stand up|Wraith Snatched Home Bailey Stand 2]]>><</link>></span>
	<br>
	<<link [[Stay still|Wraith Snatched Home Bailey Stand 2]]>><<set $_wraithOverride to true>><</link>> | <span class="red">Willpower</span>
<</if>>
<br>


:: Wraith Snatched Home Bailey Stand 2
<<pass 5>><<effects>><<getTarget>>
<<person1>>

<<if $_wraithOverride>>
	<span class="red">Your body does not obey.</span> 
<</if>>
You lunge from the floor. Your hands slam flat against the desk, scattering papers.
<br><br>

<<set _wraith to $baileyWraithPool.length gt 0 ? $baileyWraithPool.pluck() : "...">>
"<span class="wraith"><<print _wraith>></span>"
<br><br>

Bailey stands slowly. <<He>> grabs you by the back of the neck and forces you back onto the floor.<<gpain>><<pain 6>><<gstress>><<stress 6>>
<br><br>

<<if $baileyWraithSeen and $baileyWraithSeen gte 1>>
	<<His>> hand rests on your neck, holding you down. <<He>> only lets go when <<he>> sits back down.
<<else>>
	<<He>> holds you there. You can feel <<his>> grip through the fog.
	<br><br>

	"I told you to sit," <<he>> says quietly.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Wraith Snatched Home Bailey 4]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Wraith Snatched Home Bailey Still 2
<<pass 5>><<effects>><<getTarget>>
<<person1>>

You clench every muscle you can feel. The pressure behind your ribs is worse now. Your head throbs.<<ggstress>><<stress 12>><<gtrauma>><<trauma 6>>
<br><br>

"<span class="wraith">Stubborn,</span>" it hisses from somewhere behind your teeth. "<span class="wraith">Just like the serpent.</span>"<<gpain>><<pain 2>>
<br><br>

<<if $syndromeBaileyBuild gte 1>>
	Bailey's hand rests on the base of your hair. 
<</if>>

<<He>> continues writing.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Wraith Snatched Home Bailey 4]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Wraith Snatched Home Bailey 4
<<pass 10>><<effects>><<getTarget>>
<<person1>>

<<if $baileyWraithSeen and $baileyWraithSeen gte 3>>
	Bailey doesn't look up. <<His>> pen doesn't stop. <<He>> knows what comes next.
<<elseif $baileyWraithSeen and $baileyWraithSeen gte 1>>
	Bailey turns a page. <<His>> posture shifts. <<His>> free hand is flat on the desk, braced.
<<else>>
	Bailey says nothing. <<His>> pen keeps moving. <<His>> eyes meet yours.
<</if>>
<br><br>

One final pull tugs at you, the strongest one yet. Every muscle in your body tenses. Your vision tunnels.
<br><br>

<<willpowerdifficulty 400 1000 true>>
<<if $willpowerSuccess>>
	<<link [[Stand up.|Wraith Snatched Home Bailey Stand 3]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Stay still.|Wraith Snatched Home Bailey Still 3]]>><<set $baileyWraithResisted += 1>><<control `Math.floor(currentSkillValue('willpower') / 10)`>><</link>><<ggcontrol>> | <span class="green">Willpower</span>
<<else>>
	<span class="wraith"><<link [[Stand up.|Wraith Snatched Home Bailey Stand 3]]>><</link>></span>
	<br>
	<<link [[Stay still.|Wraith Snatched Home Bailey Stand 3]]>><<set $_wraithOverride to true>><</link>> | <span class="red">Willpower</span>
<</if>>
<br>


:: Wraith Snatched Home Bailey Stand 3
<<pass 5>><<effects>><<getTarget>>
<<person1>>

<<if $_wraithOverride>>
	<span class="red">Your body does not obey.</span> 
<</if>>
Your body throws itself from the floor. You hit the ground. Your fingers scrabble at the door.
<br><br>

Bailey's boot comes down hard on your hand.<<ggpain>><<pain 8>><<ggstress>><<stress 12>>
<br><br>

"<span class="wraith">Let me go,</span>" your voice whimpers. It almost sounds like you. "<span class="wraith">Please. It hurts.</span>"
<br><br>

<<if $baileyWraithSeen and $baileyWraithSeen gte 1>>
	Bailey doesn't move <<his>> boot. "Nice try," <<he>> says. <<He>> crouches, picks you up off the floor, and carries you back to <<his>> desk.
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	Bailey doesn't move <<his>> boot. <<He>> sneers down at you. <<He>> crouches, grabs you by the arm, and drags you back to <<his>> desk.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<link [[Next|`${$control >= $controlmax ? "Wraith Snatched Home Bailey Expelled" : "Wraith Snatched Home Bailey 5"}`]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Wraith Snatched Home Bailey Still 3
<<pass 5>><<effects>><<getTarget>>
<<person1>>

Your whole body shakes. Your vision goes white at the edges.<<ggstress>><<stress 12>><<ggtrauma>><<trauma 12>><<gpain>><<pain 4>>
<br><br>

Then it stops. The pressure in your chest vanishes.
<br><br>

<<if $syndromeBaileyBuild gte 1>>
	Bailey is standing over you. <<He>> puts <<his>> hand on the top of your head before pulling away.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

Bailey shuffles some paper together.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|`${$control >= $controlmax ? "Wraith Snatched Home Bailey Expelled" : "Wraith Snatched Home Bailey 5"}`]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Wraith Snatched Home Bailey 5
<<endevent>>
<<effects>><<getTarget>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
<<set _minsToSunrise to (6 * 60 - (Time.hour * 60 + Time.minute) + 1440) % 1440>>
<<if _minsToSunrise gt 0 and _minsToSunrise lte 720>><<pass _minsToSunrise>><</if>>
<<set $moonstate to "morning">>

The office window lightens. Grey, then pale gold. The light falls across <<his>> desk and onto the floor, where you sit.
<br><br>

Your fingers twitch. You're back in control. You look up. Bailey is sitting behind <<his>> desk. <<His>> pen is down. <<Hes>> watching you. <<He>>'s been awake all night.
<br><br>

<<if $baileyWraithResisted gte 3>>
	<<npcincr Bailey love 3>><<ggglove "Bailey">>
<</if>>
<<if $baileyWraithSeen and $baileyWraithSeen gte 3>>
	<<He>> turns back to <<his>> work, unbothered. <<He>> nods towards the office door.
	<br><br>
	"Go to your room."
	<br><br>
<<elseif $baileyWraithSeen and $baileyWraithSeen gte 1>>
	"Damn brat," <<he>> says. <<He>> nods towards the office door. "Always wasting my time."
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	<<He>> straightens <<his>> collar. You can make out bags under <<his>> eyes.
	<br><br>
	"<span class="red">Don't go to sleep during the blood moon,</span>" <<he>> says. <<He>> turns back to <<his>> work, nodding towards the office door.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<span class="blue"><i>You're safe until the next blood moon.</i></span>
<br><br>

<<set $baileyWraithSeen += 1>>

<<unset $baileyWraithPool>><<unset $baileyWraithResisted>>
<<endWraith>>
<<clearWraith>>
<<link [[Go to bed|Sleep]]>><<set $sleephour to 1>><<unset $possessed>><<canvas-model-override "clear">><<endevent>><</link>><<ltiredness>>
<br>


:: Wraith Snatched Home Bailey Expelled
<<endevent>>
<<pass 5>><<effects>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

<span class="gold">You stop.</span>
<br><br>

You can feel it pushing against you. It knows it's losing. You dig in. You're not letting go.
<br><br>

You double over. It tears itself out of you, knowing it's been bested. A pair of pale, translucent arms erupt from your chest.<<gggtrauma>><<trauma 50>>
<br><br>

The pale figure floats before you.
<<if $wraith.state is "haunt">>
	It scratches at its scarred neck.
	<br><br>

	"<span class="wraith">You don't know the cost, thief.</span>"
<<elseif $wraith.state is "despair">>
	It scratches at its bare neck.
	<br><br>

	"<span class="wraith">You felt it too. You know what it is to lose yourself.</span>"
<<else>>
	It looks at you with something like interest.
	<br><br>

	"<span class="wraith">Impressive. Stubborn. You'll be mine yet.</span>"
<</if>>
<br><br>

A torrent of water erupts from nowhere, engulfing it. Its pale eyes hold yours through it. Then it's gone with the water.
<br><br>

The office is quiet. The blood moon still outside. Your hands are on the hard floor. You're yourself. If Bailey saw the pale figure, <<he>> makes no indication of it.
<br><br>

Bailey shifts in <<his>> chair. You look at <<him>>. <<Hes>> looking right back at you with unreadable eyes. You can make out bags under <<his>> eyes.
<br><br>

"<span class="red">Don't go to sleep during the blood moon,</span>" <<he>> says. <<He>> turns back to <<his>> work, nodding towards the office door. "Get out."<<npcincr Bailey love 3>><<ggglove "Bailey">>
<br><br>

<span class="blue"><i>You're safe until the next blood moon.</i></span>
<br><br>

<<set $baileyWraithSeen += 1>>
<<unset $baileyWraithPool>><<unset $baileyWraithResisted>>
<<endWraith>>
<<set $wraith.state to "">>
<<clearWraith>>
<<set $wraithSkip to true>>
<<link [[Go to bed|Sleep]]>><<set $sleephour to 1>><<unset $possessed>><<canvas-model-override "clear">><<endevent>><</link>><<ltiredness>>
<br>
